OL,3,GNEWSA'Running 10 miles for our friend
OL,4,Awas emotional'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jane Tomlinson Run For All
OL,7,FYorkshire Marathon and 10-mile event
OL,8,Fwas held earlier, with runners and
OL,9,Fparticipants competing for a variety of
OL,10,Fgood causes.
OL,12,FNow in its 13th year, the marathon
OL,13,Froute started and finished at the
OL,14,FUniversity of York, passing York
OL,15,FMinster before heading into the
OL,16,Fcountryside to Stamford Bridge and back
OL,17,Fthrough Murton.
OL,19,FAmy, Jess and Kirsty were running for
OL,20,FClaire's Wish Foundation, a charity set
OL,21,Fup in memory of their friend, who died
OL,22,Ffrom cancer in August.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
