OL,3,GNEWSA'Running 10 miles for our friend
OL,4,Awas emotional'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWearing T-shirts with a photo of Claire
OL,7,Fon their back, Amy described the day as
OL,8,Femotional. She said: "I would say it's
OL,9,Fquite raw, it was quite recent, but she
OL,10,Fwould have loved to know we were doing
OL,11,Fit in her honour."
